  - id: fire_sealed_scroll
    displayName: Fire-Sealed Scroll
    flavorText: The LORD indicts Israel's neighbors and Judah one by one for their
      atrocities before the same judgment formula lands, unavoidably, on Israel itself.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A rhetorical trap - Amos indicts Israel's neighbors and Judah one by
      one for their own well-known atrocities, letting a Judean/Israelite audience
      nod along in agreement, before the same 'for three transgressions...and for
      four' formula lands, unavoidably, on Israel itself.
